<title>USA: Shelter Components Corp Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Shelter Components Corp Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>ELKHART, Ind. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(000's omitted except per share data)</p>
<p>				 Three Months Ended	 Year Ended</p>
<p>				     December 31,	  December 31,</p>
<p>	INCOME STATEMENT	1996	 1995     1996     1995</p>
<p> Net Sales		   $123,957  $117,670 $521,022 $462,323</p>
<p> Cost of sales		108,152   100,088  447,701  393,775</p>
<p>   Gross profit		15,805    17,582   73,321   68,548</p>
<p> Commission income		632	 655    2,459    3,005</p>
<p>   Total			 16,437    18,237   75,780   71,553</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>administrative expenses</p>
<p>				   15,903    14,258   60,194   52,709</p>
<p>   Operating income	     534     3,979   15,588   18,844</p>
<p>Gain on sale of carpet</p>
<p>   business		     5,919	  --    5,919	 --</p>
<p> Interest income		   75	  93	177	142</p>
<p> Interest expense	     (433)     (559)  (1,831)  (2,472)</p>
<p>Income before income taxes</p>
<p>				    6,095     3,513   19,851   16,514</p>
<p> Income taxes		   2,788     1,432    8,153    6,476</p>
<p>   Net income		   3,307     2,081   11,698   10,038</p>
<p> Earnings per share(a)	 0.42	0.27     1.51     1.31</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>   outstanding(a)	     7,783     7,764    7,738    7,680</p>
<p>NOTE: (a)  All periods presented reflect the 5-for-4 stock split effective 7/8/96.</p>
<p>Included in Q4 1996 net income is $3.2-million, or $0.41/shr, gain on sale of carpet business. Q4 1996 also includes physical inventory and other year-end adjustments which decreased net income by about $1.5 million, or $0.19/shr, related primarily to divested carpet business.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
